// Stand-in for the UNCONDITIONAL boxsize_c.cla manifest entry (SE wave 3,
// spec 3.5) in this fake runtime-module directory. Deliberately empty, same
// reason as this directory's datetime_c.cla stand-in: driveManifestSplice
// always adds "boxsize_c.cla" to neededMods on the C lane, so
// --rtdir testdata/rtinc/rt needs SOME file by that name. The real module
// lives at runtime/clarus/boxsize_c.cla.
